external/submodule_commit_hash_records lost its devxlib line (2026-10-27) and its
pw2qmcpack line (2026-11-12); the
format has no comments, so the notice for that file is here only.

Bug fixes in upstream code: Modules/qes_read_module.f90 and qes_bcast_module.f90
read and broadcast the l attribute of pseudo_file without allocating it, which
crashed every XML read in a FoX build and returned nothing otherwise.

Summary of the changes: a batched GPU Sternheimer engine and batched nscf for
ph.x, GPU paths for EPW, OpenMP over k in two wannier90 routines, and a central
table of run-time switches (qefast/SWITCHES.md). With QEF_STH=0 and
QEF_NSCF_ROT=0 ph.x takes QE's own loop.

New source files are under qefast/, and in LR_Modules/ (qef_*.f90, sth_*.f90),
PHonon/PH/qef_phq_fuse.f90 and PW/src/sth_nscf_symrot.f90. They carry an SPDX
tag; several adapt upstream routines, and those portions remain under the
copyright of their QE and EPW authors.

Removed from the upstream tree (2026-11-12): the configure/make build
(install/, configure, every Makefile, make.depend and makedeps.sh outside
test-suite/ and external/), dev-tools/, archive/, .travis.yml and the GitLab CI
files; the packages CPV, COUPLE, GUI, GWW, KCW, PWCOND, QEHeat and XSpectra,
with their test-suite cases; the external/pw2qmcpack submodule. CMakeLists.txt,
external/CMakeLists.txt, test-suite/CMakeLists.txt, test-suite/Makefile,
test-suite/jobconfig and test-suite/userconfig.tmp were edited to match. qe-fast
builds with CMake only.

Documentation: README.md was replaced and the upstream text moved unchanged to
README.QE.md. CONTRIBUTING.md and .github/pull_request_template.md were
rewritten for this fork. logo.jpg is the upstream project's mark. It is kept
for README.QE.md only and is not a logo of qe-fast.


